                                                                <rect key="frame" x="16" y="60" width="329" height="376"/>
                                                                <string key="text">The purpose of creating this portal is to bridge the educational gap between individuals with disabilities and the general population. Education is a fundamental right for every individual, so why should people with disabilities be deprived of this right? Let's come together to make education accessible for everyone. On this portal, the number of seats allocated for students with disabilities in schools can be registered, and individuals with disabilities can apply for admission here.</string>
